!!! CORRECTION (appended after the fact) - the block above labelled
"=== final: hook back to 0U, then the vehicle image" did NOT have the hook
back at 0U: the source still said 460000U for that build, so the
bench-watchdog image uploaded there (858a5a32...) contained the hang hook.
The mistake was found by reading the tree afterwards, not by the build; the
hook was then set back to 0U in src/bench/BenchMain.cpp and the rebuilt image
is ddba3b9d... The vehicle-image upload that followed is unaffected (the
vehicle image cannot contain the hook - src/main.cpp asserts it and the bench
tree is not compiled there). Recorded in DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md D28.
